[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WARNING]
Ambassador to Hailberg

[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WARNING_desc]
We should send an ambassador to these isolated reindeer to see what they are like. Maybe we can just threaten them and they will submit to us and pay tribute.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WARNING]
派往海尔伯格的使臣

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WARNING_desc]
我们应该向北方这些与世隔绝的驯鹿们派出使臣，先试探一下她们的情况。也许只需要稍作威胁，他们就会乖乖地听从我们的命令，向我们臣服和朝贡。

